      "message": "That works too but this demonstrates how developers can use the API without worrying about the call order (thanks to EC_ERROR_BUSY). It\u0027s obvious here in flapjack/board.c but it\u0027s not always obvious when other sources are accessed differently. So, this order flexibility is worth the demonstration.",
